{"id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-expression.md","title":"Expression","display":"df-expression — Expression","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-expression","aliases":["92-df-expression"],"display":"df-expression — Expression","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-expression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-expression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-expression — Expression"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-expression-—-Expression-$E$\">df-expression — Expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (set of symbols)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}\\)</span> (definition-target constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expression} \\vdash \\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma) \\coloneqq \\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expression} \\vdash \\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma) \\coloneqq \\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> : 表达式集（符号表上所有有限串）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>中符号组成的有限序列集</li>\n<li>表达式是符号表中符号的有限序列</li>\n<li>公式和项是满足文法约束的表达式；证明则是公式的有限序列，通常属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\((\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，不能与单个 token 串混为一谈</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-expression-—-Expression-$E$","text":"df-expression — Expression $E$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}expression} \\vdash \\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma) \\coloneqq \\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma))^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":827,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]] - 表达式"},{"id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$ and $R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k$ (arity and syntactic relation, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])"},{"id":"2b8fcf92581114e5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (syntactic-object class, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])"},{"id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (syntactic-object class, see [[92-df-expression]], [[92-df-signature]])"},{"id":"6785ab5b9adf7eb7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (candidate expression set, see [[92-df-expression]])"},{"id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"r